.TH PSGetOutputLayer 3 2024-03-31 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSGetOutputLayer\fR

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
PSLayer  *
.br
\fBPSGetOutputLayer\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Return the output layer (basically, the last layer) of \fImodel\fR. If \fImodel\fR is part of a multi-model chain, the function will return the output layer of the output model (the last model) of the chain.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The output layer or \fINULL\fR if:

.RS 4
\[bu] \fImodel\fR is \fINULL\fR or \fImodel\fR has no layers.
.br

\[bu] \fImodel\fR is part of a multi-model chain, but the chain is broken.
.br
.RE

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1)
